The main thing is to believe, and fate will certainly
will smile at you.

16
00:01:14.505 --> 00:01:16.863
After the song we will continue the broadcast.

17
00:01:19.900 --> 00:01:22.498
- Live up, guys!
- Let's run.

18
00:01:22.897 --> 00:01:26.174
- Hello.
- Hello, we are Eclipse!

19
00:01:27.852 --> 00:01:30.130
Good afternoon. Hello.

20
00:01:30.210 --> 00:01:31.688
Hello!

21
00:01:34.765 --> 00:01:36.444
It seems to me...

22
