- Salt?
- Good afternoon. Hello, are you here?

47
00:03:00.559 --> 00:03:03.916
Yes, this is the leader of the Eclipse group -
Baek In Hyuk.

48
00:03:03.996 --> 00:03:05.914
What? Stump?

49
00:03:07.113 --> 00:03:09.910
- Stump...
- Baek In Hyuk!

50
00:03:10.190 --> 00:03:13.906
God. My God, Sol! Hurt? How are you?

51
00:03:15.824 --> 00:03:16.824
Salt...

52
00:03:27.852 --> 00:03:30.490
Sorry, I probably hurt my skin.

53
00:03:31.768 --> 00:03:33.447
I'll bring the ointment now.

54
00:03:39.880 --> 00:03:41.359
What kind of person am I...

55
00:03:43.516 --> 00:03:46.434
Unfortunately, the answer is no.

56
00:03:46.913 --> 00:03:48.112
That's it...

57
00:04:12.408 --> 00:04:14.565
- Congratulations!
- Hooray!

58
00:04:15.045 --> 00:04:17.083
Now there will be attempt number two.

59
00:04:17.163 --> 00:04:20.080
So, after In Hyuk we have...

60
00:04:20.240 --> 00:04:22.158
Song Jae! Will you try it?

61
00:04:22.438 --> 00:04:23.836
Well... Let's go.

62
00:04:26.673 --> 00:04:28.272
They're calling you.

63
00:04:33.067 --> 00:04:36.823
