Don't know.

73
00:05:22.537 --> 00:05:23.537
Okay...

74
00:05:24.416 --> 00:05:27.133
Maybe you've heard of Eclipse?
We debuted...

75
00:05:27.213 --> 00:05:28.292
I didn't hear it!

76
00:05:28.372 --> 00:05:31.768
And this is a failure! What a pity.

77
00:05:31.848 --> 00:05:34.605
Hello, thank you very much,
what they answered.

78
00:05:34.685 --> 00:05:37.722
The program "Friends of Ten-Ten" is on air.
and I'm the host Hyun.

79
00:05:37.802 --> 00:05:39.161
I'm folding.

80
00:05:39.241 --> 00:05:41.439
Wait, you've won a prize!

81
00:05:42.318 --> 00:05:44.955
- Leave it.
- The weather is great outside!

82
00:05:45.035 --> 00:05:49.750
With new sneakers you'll start
spend more time outside.

83
00:05:49.830 --> 00:05:51.189
No need.

84
00:05:53.267 --> 00:05:56.464
