147
00:10:40.899 --> 00:10:44.535
Damn manager...
I wish I could get out of there as soon as possible.

148
00:10:44.615 --> 00:10:46.494
- Eat?
- First, take a shower.

149
00:10:46.853 --> 00:10:48.931
- I won’t give it!
- Grandmother!

150
00:10:49.770 --> 00:10:52.567
Geum, Geum, Geum, take her watch away!

151
00:10:53.167 --> 00:10:55.524
She will play and give it back herself.

152
00:10:55.644 --> 00:10:57.483
- Crap!
- That's it.

153
00:10:58.162 --> 00:11:01.518
Nooo! Mom, mom, mom!

154
00:11:01.598 --> 00:11:03.676
Okay, okay. Okay, I'll take it.

155
00:11:03.756 --> 00:11:05.954
Mother. Mother.

156
00:11:06.034 --> 00:11:09.950
Give it to me and I'll show you a trick.

157
00:11:10.709 --> 00:11:13.027
Focus?

158
00:11:15.704 --> 00:11:18.901
