168
00:11:40.000 --> 00:11:42.118
What passion, what passion!

169
00:11:42.198 --> 00:11:44.515
Check it out, dedicated fan.

170
00:11:44.995 --> 00:11:48.192
God. What about the concert today?

171
00:11:48.831 --> 00:11:51.828
Yes. The first one in five years, finally.

172
00:12:02.657 --> 00:12:05.495
Ryu Sung Jae! What's wrong with you?

173
00:12:10.689 --> 00:12:13.487
You tell the director
that you won't be filming.

174
00:12:13.566 --> 00:12:15.005
Are you crazy?

175
00:12:19.201 --> 00:12:20.320
Song Jae.

176
00:12:20.599 --> 00:12:22.278
I told you so.

177
00:12:22.358 --> 00:12:24.955
Once the filming is over, go for a walk wherever you want.

178
00:12:25.035 --> 00:12:26.434
I want to leave.

179
00:12:26.753 --> 00:12:28.032
And not on vacation.

180
00:12:31.868 --> 00:12:33.467
And you leave the dressing room.

181
00:12:34.106 --> 00:12:37.742
Come out and take a look at least once
how many people came here.

182
00:12:37.862 --> 00:12:39.700
And are you sorry, puppy?

183
00:12:39.780 --> 00:12:40.780
No.

184
00:12:43.177 --> 00:12:44.177
I don't regret it.

185
00:12:45.694 --> 00:12:49.291
When a man reaches the end
your life path,

186
00:12:49.371 --> 00:12:50.809
