187
00:12:50.889 --> 00:12:55.964
Today you won't be able to change anything,
I have very important things to do.

188
00:12:56.044 --> 00:12:59.481
Is this how you deal with regular clients?
So I'm leaving.

189
00:12:59.560 --> 00:13:02.198
So why are you starting right away?

190
00:13:02.677 --> 00:13:06.274
This is not, by any chance, a bridge across
Samdochon River?

191
00:13:07.233 --> 00:13:09.790
You liked the Hotel del Luna. God.

192
00:13:10.030 --> 00:13:12.987
Or maybe you are Jang Man Wol?

193
00:13:13.067 --> 00:13:15.704
Screenwriters at least use mythology
inquired.

194
00:13:15.784 --> 00:13:17.183
Well done Lee Seung Man!

195
00:13:17.343 --> 00:13:19.620
Now you can cross the river!

196
00:13:19.700 --> 00:13:22.897
And I would only find out after death.

197
00:13:23.536 --> 00:13:24.855
Ready.

198
00:13:28.052 --> 00:13:29.451
I'll upload it now!

199
00:13:33.087 --> 00:13:34.446
I'm late, I'm late!

200
00:13:35.085 --> 00:13:36.085
Crap.

201
00:13:47.033 --> 00:13:48.951
