202
00:14:02.977 --> 00:14:05.614
You! So are you going to make eyes?

203
00:14:06.853 --> 00:14:09.371
I just love you!

204
00:14:12.328 --> 00:14:13.328
See you!

205
00:14:13.766 --> 00:14:14.766
Bye.

206
00:14:18.202 --> 00:14:23.437
Without any worries, we'll run away right now,
Let's run away now...

207
00:14:25.315 --> 00:14:26.434
Are you happy?

208
00:14:26.513 --> 00:14:29.071
Of course, the first concert in my life!

209
00:14:29.191 --> 00:14:30.669
Thank you, Hyun Joo.

210
00:14:30.749 --> 00:14:31.948
For what?

211
00:14:32.028 --> 00:14:34.585
For changing the car,
to give you a ride?

212
00:14:36.184 --> 00:14:38.821
Look in the package, there's a gift there.

213
00:14:39.221 --> 00:14:40.221
Which?

214
00:14:42.817 --> 00:14:43.817
CLASS OF 2009, JAGAM

215
00:14:44.496 --> 00:14:47.532
What-oh-oh?!

216
00:14:47.612 --> 00:14:50.609
My colleague's younger brother
graduated from Jagam,

217
00:14:50.689 --> 00:14:52.208
I borrowed the album.

218
00:14:52.288 --> 00:14:55.564
What's going on with you, Hyun Joo?

219
00:14:55.644 --> 00:14:57.443
Was Sun Jae in class number five?

220
00:14:57.842 --> 00:15:01.199
Fifth. Fifth, fifth, fifth.

221
00:15:03.437 --> 00:15:04.915
God, god, oh my god.

222
00:15:04.995 --> 00:15:06.833
He was beautiful even then!

223
00:15:06.913 --> 00:15:09.071
I would grab him and run away!

224
00:15:09.151 --> 00:15:12.308
It was long overdue.
You had every chance.

225
00:15:12.388 --> 00:15:15.544
And don't talk. He studied nearby
at a nearby school.

226
00:15:15.824 --> 00:15:19.021
How could I not notice
such a bright star?

227
00:15:19.221 --> 00:15:21.459
If only I had hit on him...

228
00:15:21.538 --> 00:15:25.015
And at that time you were running
behind another idiot.

229
00:15:25.574 --> 00:15:26.574
For whom?

230
00:15:28.771 --> 00:15:31.608
That's it, I remembered. Exactly.

231
00:15:31.728 --> 00:15:33.726
What class was he in?

232
00:15:33.806 --> 00:15:35.045
It's not on the album.

233
00:15:35.405 --> 00:15:36.763
After the accident, I think?

234
00:15:37.642 --> 00:15:41.838
Yes, after the accident he got into a fight
with guys from another school.

235
00:15:42.078 --> 00:15:44.795
What saved him from expulsion was
that he left on his own.

236
00:15:44.915 --> 00:15:45.915
I didn't know.

237
00:15:49.311 --> 00:15:50.669
- By the way...
- What?

238
00:15:50.949 --> 00:15:52.228
Will I cut out Sung Jae's photo?

239
00:15:52.308 --> 00:15:53.946
Cut it out, the album is not mine.

240
00:15:54.026 --> 00:15:55.704
Say thank you to your colleague.

241
00:16:09.251 --> 00:16:10.529
Thank you.

242
00:16:21.359 --> 00:16:22.359
Come on in.

243
00:16:26.154 --> 00:16:27.273
Don't push!

244
00:16:28.392 --> 00:16:29.870
I can't wait!

245
00:16:40.460 --> 00:16:41.460
Salt!

246
00:16:43.976 --> 00:16:45.614
