- How are you?

247
00:16:45.694 --> 00:16:47.493
Fine. You're early.

248
00:16:58.641 --> 00:17:01.359
FOREVER GRATEFUL

249
00:17:11.788 --> 00:17:13.586
So, what are we going to eat?

250
00:17:13.666 --> 00:17:15.025
- Teokbokki?
- I agree.

251
00:17:15.105 --> 00:17:18.901
First concert in five years
and she came for Sun Jae.

252
00:17:18.981 --> 00:17:21.179
Do you think In Hyuk is a backup dancer?

253
00:17:21.259 --> 00:17:23.097
Let the actor fail.

254
00:17:23.377 --> 00:17:26.054
Come on, get out of here, friend.

255
00:17:26.134 --> 00:17:28.851
That's why there are rumors
about disbandment.

256
00:17:28.931 --> 00:17:30.050
That's it.

257
00:17:30.170 --> 00:17:34.206
