258
00:17:34.286 --> 00:17:36.284
Sue these fools, and that’s it.

259
00:17:40.759 --> 00:17:41.759
Wait.

260
00:17:45.794 --> 00:17:48.671
- Hello?
- Hello, this is Choi Jong Hoon

261
00:17:48.751 --> 00:17:50.150
from "Good Cinema".

262
00:17:50.230 --> 00:17:53.347
Have you sent your resume?
for internship?

263
00:17:53.946 --> 00:17:55.225
Yes, I did!

264
00:17:55.305 --> 00:17:58.661
You can drive up right now
for an interview?

265
00:17:58.941 --> 00:18:02.338
- Right now?
- Yes, we are in a bit of a hurry...

266
00:18:02.857 --> 00:18:06.414
- If it doesn't work out...
- I'll come. I can. Thank you.

267
00:18:08.212 --> 00:18:11.129
Sol, where are you going? Two hours before the concert.

268
00:18:11.249 --> 00:18:14.126
For an interview. I'll be back soon.
Get in line.

269
00:18:14.206 --> 00:18:15.325
Don't be late!

270
00:18:36.583 --> 00:18:37.583
Ready.

271
00:18:54.006 --> 00:18:55.006
Wow...

272
00:19:11.469 --> 00:19:13.387
Hello, how can I help?

273
00:19:13.467 --> 00:19:17.502
I'm talking about the interview,
you called me recently.

274
00:19:17.582 --> 00:19:19.021
Yes, exactly!

275
00:19:21.778 --> 00:19:23.696
Yes, exactly...

276
00:19:24.895 --> 00:19:25.895
Yes.

277
00:19:26.693 --> 00:19:30.529
We would accept you, but, you see,
this lousy booth has two floors

278
00:19:30.609 --> 00:19:32.208
and not a single elevator.

279
00:19:33.047 --> 00:19:34.486
I'm really sorry.

280
00:19:34.565 --> 00:19:35.844
No big loss!

281
00:19:36.324 --> 00:19:39.201
If it weren't for the stairs,
They would definitely take me.

282
00:19:43.916 --> 00:19:46.034
Shall we go see Sung Jae?

283
00:19:58.741 --> 00:19:59.900
Sol, will you be there soon?

284
00:19:59.980 --> 00:20:01.698
The concert is about to begin!

285
00:20:17.802 --> 00:20:20.200
Girl, girl, girl!

286
00:20:21.319 --> 00:20:24.476
Excuse me, can you let me through?

287
00:20:24.555 --> 00:20:27.313
- You didn’t have time to come in?
- I was in a hurry...

288
00:20:27.393 --> 00:20:29.351
Entry after the start is prohibited.

289
00:20:29.431 --> 00:20:31.349
I know, I know...

290
00:20:37.502 --> 00:20:39.620
It's the holidays, you can't get a taxi.

291
00:20:39.700 --> 00:20:43.257
I suffered so much on the bus
and finally arrived

292
00:20:43.576 --> 00:20:45.455
but I was late.

293
00:20:46.174 --> 00:20:48.771
You are clearly not the last person here.

294
00:20:48.851 --> 00:20:49.851
Well?

295
00:20:50.130 --> 00:20:51.369
Miss it?

296
00:20:55.365 --> 00:20:58.162
But we really can't.

297
00:20:58.322 --> 00:21:02.038
My God, how cold it is. How cold it is.

298
00:21:07.193 --> 00:21:09.790
Show me your ticket and I'll guide you.

299
00:21:09.870 --> 00:21:11.868
Seriously? Thank you!

300
00:21:12.547 --> 00:21:13.547
Just a second.

301
00:21:16.623 --> 00:21:18.022
What? In terms of?

302
00:21:22.218 --> 00:21:23.218
Where is he?

303
00:21:31.369 --> 00:21:32.448
This is the end.

304
00:21:56.024 --> 00:22:01.818
Ryu Sung Jae, Baek In Hyuk, Park Hyun Soo,
Jay and Ek-lips!

305
00:23:32.408 --> 00:23:33.526
This...

306
00:23:35.045 --> 00:23:38.601
This is my first song.

307
00:23:40.000 --> 00:23:43.277
I haven't performed it for a long time.

308
00:23:44.476 --> 00:23:46.074
First song?

309
00:23:46.434 --> 00:23:47.473
What is he talking about?

310
00:24:03.057 --> 00:24:05.215
She wasn't on the list!

311
00:25:45.395 --> 00:25:48.631
Yes... If I was so moved on the street,

312
00:25:49.031 --> 00:25:51.269
what would happen to me in the hall?

313
00:25:55.065 --> 00:25:56.424
First snow.

314
00:25:59.620 --> 00:26:01.139
Sun Jae will be happy.

315
00:26:03.257 --> 00:26:04.257
It's time to go home.

316
00:26:20.879 --> 00:26:23.556
What kind of day is today?

317
00:26:33.626 --> 00:26:35.704
In Hyuk, calm down.

318
00:26:40.539 --> 00:26:42.657
- Calm down!
- Go away!

319
00:26:43.377 --> 00:26:45.055
- You...
- In Hyuk!

320
00:26:45.135 --> 00:26:48.971
-Are you kidding me?
- No fists! Come here!

321
00:26:49.570 --> 00:26:50.769
In Hyuk!

322
00:26:53.327 --> 00:26:55.844
How can you talk about leaving?

323
00:26:56.364 --> 00:27:00.360
- Tired?
- In Hyuk! Hush, hush, hush.

324
00:27:02.078 --> 00:27:03.117
After.

325
00:27:03.956 --> 00:27:06.513
I want to be alone.

326
00:27:09.590 --> 00:27:11.828
OK. Do what you want.

327
00:27:14.266 --> 00:27:16.863
What's wrong with you guys?

328
00:27:16.983 --> 00:27:18.262
In Hyuk!

329
00:27:47.752 --> 00:27:50.629
Why is the stop so far away?

330
00:27:50.709 --> 00:27:53.546
The bridge is also so long.

331
00:27:56.823 --> 00:27:58.701
What? In terms of?

332
00:27:59.341 --> 00:28:01.179
I can't get stuck!

333
00:28:03.217 --> 00:28:06.733
Like this. Drive a little more, okay?
Please.

334
00:28:12.567 --> 00:28:13.926
Right here?

335
00:28:19.481 --> 00:28:23.636
We would accept you, but, you see,
this lousy booth has two floors

336
00:28:23.716 --> 00:28:25.115
and not a single elevator.

337
00:28:25.195 --> 00:28:28.112
Show me your ticket and I'll guide you.

338
00:28:45.295 --> 00:28:46.295
It's cold...

339
00:30:06.813 --> 00:30:07.972
What happened?

340
00:30:09.770 --> 00:30:12.767
Is your stroller broken?

341
00:30:15.285 --> 00:30:16.444
Yes...

342
00:30:16.683 --> 00:30:20.040
Open your mouth, say something!
This is Sung Jae!

343
00:30:20.120 --> 00:30:21.998
Have you swallowed your tongue?

344
00:30:39.620 --> 00:30:40.779
I see they are frozen.

345
00:30:50.170 --> 00:30:51.808
Thank you.

346
00:30:55.165 --> 00:30:56.284
Why are you crying?

347
00:30:57.163 --> 00:30:58.242
I didn't cry.

348
00:30:59.401 --> 00:31:02.717
It's out of joy.

349
00:31:04.995 --> 00:31:09.870
To be honest, I'm your, your, your fan.

350
00:31:10.589 --> 00:31:11.589
It's visible.

351
00:31:23.696 --> 00:31:24.696
You're funny.

352
00:31:24.935 --> 00:31:27.932
GRAB SUN JAE AND RUN
This is my nickname on your fan cafe.

353
00:31:28.771 --> 00:31:31.728
I came up with it 10 years ago.

354
00:31:31.808 --> 00:31:33.167
Never changed it!

355
00:31:33.606 --> 00:31:34.606
Thank you.

356
00:31:35.924 --> 00:31:37.483
Thank you.

357
00:31:42.078 --> 00:31:44.076
I wanted to move on with my life.

358
00:31:47.433 --> 00:31:50.390
Just for everything, thank you for everything.

359
00:31:50.709 --> 00:31:52.587
For the fact that you exist in the world.

360
00:31:53.666 --> 00:31:55.784
All the fans are grateful to you.

361
00:31:59.141 --> 00:32:00.260
Will you get home?

362
00:32:00.859 --> 00:32:02.897
- I...
- Should I give you a ride?

363
00:32:04.416 --> 00:32:08.132
- What?
- You are my fan, I won’t leave you.

364
00:32:18.402 --> 00:32:20.999
A friend came to pick me up.

365
00:32:30.549 --> 00:32:33.347
Thank you for everything.

366
00:32:42.138 --> 00:32:43.257
Take it.

367
00:32:50.330 --> 00:32:52.008
Wait a second.

368
00:32:53.367 --> 00:32:55.085
I don't have any gifts...

369
00:32:56.084 --> 00:32:59.840
but you love it.

370
00:33:01.558 --> 00:33:02.797
Hold it.

371
00:33:17.502 --> 00:33:21.059
Mother. After the accident, someone saved me.

372
00:33:21.419 --> 00:33:23.257
Do you remember his name?

373
00:33:24.655 --> 00:33:28.372
No! This was back when!

374
00:33:29.171 --> 00:33:31.369
- Why suddenly?
- Just.

375
00:33:31.449 --> 00:33:34.805
I met someone today,
That's what I remembered.

376
00:33:35.165 --> 00:33:37.363
It's a pity that I couldn't thank him.

377
00:34:05.814 --> 00:34:06.814
Exactly!

378
00:34:08.052 --> 00:34:11.648
Exactly. I should have asked for an autograph.

379
00:34:16.364 --> 00:34:18.681
I will dream about this hot water bottle.

380
00:34:29.950 --> 00:34:30.950
What?

381
00:34:35.065 --> 00:34:36.583
It seemed, perhaps?

382
00:34:49.451 --> 00:34:52.288
Is Sung Jae's wrist roughly like this?

383
00:35:05.514 --> 00:35:09.071
Just look at him
what's up!

384
00:35:11.309 --> 00:35:14.905
Yes... In real life he is simply incredible.

385
00:35:14.985 --> 00:35:17.502
The camera doesn't convey all the beauty.

386
00:35:18.022 --> 00:35:21.538
God. God, it's crazy! Go crazy!

387
00:35:24.535 --> 00:35:27.652
I have nothing to do with it. These are all your collarbones.

388
00:35:27.772 --> 00:35:31.369
What is a man like... And this...

389
00:35:34.166 --> 00:35:40.080
GENERAL DIRECTOR

390
00:36:22.757 --> 00:36:24.955
I saw Ryu Sung Jae in the lobby!

391
00:36:25.035 --> 00:36:26.953
Is it true? I'm jealous!

392
00:36:27.033 --> 00:36:29.351
And what is he like in life? Handsome, huh?

393
00:36:29.431 --> 00:36:33.147
- Unreal, honestly.
- If only I could take a look at him.

394
00:36:56.723 --> 00:36:58.202
- The articles have been published.
- What's there?

395
00:36:58.282 --> 00:37:00.799
- Again they are for their own.
- What if it’s true?

396
00:37:00.879 --> 00:37:03.117
- I don't believe.
- Journalists lie.

397
00:37:03.197 --> 00:37:04.875
How could he kill himself?

398
00:37:05.395 --> 00:37:07.113
What nonsense?

399
00:37:08.272 --> 00:37:10.829
Song Jae was just in front of me recently.

400
00:37:12.507 --> 00:37:15.265
Someone is spreading rumors again.

401
00:37:34.765 --> 00:37:39.201
-What happened to Sun Jae? Poor...
- Is he breathing or not?

402
00:37:44.036 --> 00:37:46.873
Can't be. It's not Sun Jae, it's not him!

403
00:37:47.992 --> 00:37:49.111
No...

404
00:37:50.030 --> 00:37:51.149
What a horror...

405
00:37:55.744 --> 00:37:57.023
They take him to the hospital.

406
00:37:57.103 --> 00:37:58.422
Are they taking you to the hospital?

407
00:38:18.721 --> 00:38:21.119
Move away! You can't go here!

408
00:38:40.180 --> 00:38:41.339
What to do?

409
00:39:06.154 --> 00:39:07.154
Discharge!

410
00:39:07.912 --> 00:39:09.870
- Voltage!
- I'm serving!

411
00:39:20.979 --> 00:39:22.058
Served!

412
00:39:22.577 --> 00:39:23.577
Discharge!

413
00:39:31.768 --> 00:39:32.768
Voltage!

414
00:39:33.287 --> 00:39:34.287
Discharge!

415
00:39:43.996 --> 00:39:46.553
January 1, 2023...

416
00:39:46.913 --> 00:39:48.352
Patient Ryu Sung Jae...

417
00:39:48.671 --> 00:39:49.950
...passed away.

418
00:40:01.459 --> 00:40:03.616
Ryu Sung Jae of ECLIPSE PASSES AWAY

419
00:40:03.856 --> 00:40:05.375
Song Jae...

420
00:40:06.733 --> 00:40:07.733
No...

421
00:40:08.052 --> 00:40:09.530
No, no, no...

422
00:40:10.330 --> 00:40:11.330
No.

423
00:40:14.725 --> 00:40:16.204
RYU SUN JAE

424
00:40:22.597 --> 00:40:24.555
THE SUDDEN DEATH OF RYU SUN JAE

425
00:40:27.832 --> 00:40:28.951
I see they are frozen.

426
00:40:29.510 --> 00:40:33.986
No. No, that's not true.
You were alive recently.

427
00:40:38.302 --> 00:40:39.302
Thank you...

428
00:40:40.380 --> 00:40:41.578
that you live.

429
00:40:45.375 --> 00:40:46.375
Song Jae...

430
00:40:47.812 --> 00:40:49.930
Move on with your life.

431
00:40:50.290 --> 00:40:51.688
The weather is good.

432
00:40:52.847 --> 00:40:54.765
It even snowed.

433
00:40:55.365 --> 00:40:57.722
You are happy when he comes.

434
00:40:59.001 --> 00:41:02.198
You have to live, why did you do this? For what?

435
00:41:36.084 --> 00:41:37.084
Salt!

436
00:41:37.802 --> 00:41:40.200
Didn't sleep very well, huh?

437
00:41:40.280 --> 00:41:43.357
Tell me what you dream about
since you're yelling like that.

438
00:41:43.437 --> 00:41:44.437
Bulldog?

439
00:41:44.915 --> 00:41:45.915
Bulldog?

440
00:41:49.391 --> 00:41:50.589
Listen...

441
00:41:50.669 --> 00:41:51.748
Am I in class?

442
00:41:51.828 --> 00:41:54.585
Yes, in class. Not at home.

443
00:41:54.665 --> 00:41:56.903
You haven't woken up yet, perhaps?

444
00:41:56.983 --> 00:41:59.101
Here's how. Is this a dream?

445
00:41:59.181 --> 00:42:00.460
Is this a dream?

446
00:42:00.659 --> 00:42:01.818
How interesting.

447
00:42:01.978 --> 00:42:03.257
Come to your senses.

448
00:42:03.337 --> 00:42:06.414
Rise! One, two, three!

449
00:42:08.731 --> 00:42:10.729
Wait until you wake up.

450
00:42:11.489 --> 00:42:16.204
So where did we stop? On 64th?

451
00:42:16.963 --> 00:42:17.963
What's wrong with you?

452
00:42:22.597 --> 00:42:24.076
Is this really a dream?

453
00:42:25.834 --> 00:42:26.913
Then maybe...

454
00:42:29.351 --> 00:42:30.351
Here's Jagam!

455
00:42:35.065 --> 00:42:39.061
Lim Sol! Lim Sol! Lim Sol!

456
00:42:49.451 --> 00:42:51.688
-Where is Ryu Sung Jae?
- What?

457
00:42:52.208 --> 00:42:53.966
Where is Sun Jae?

458
00:42:59.800 --> 00:43:03.596
Jang Ji Hoo, Park Tae Hwan,
this is the last rehearsal

459
00:43:03.676 --> 00:43:05.714
before the competition in Beijing.

460
00:43:09.431 --> 00:43:12.667
We ask you immediately
approach the pool.

461
00:43:29.850 --> 00:43:32.448
COMPETITION REHEARSAL
BEIJING UNIVERSITY 2008

462
00:43:54.226 --> 00:43:59.381
One, two, three, four.

463
00:43:59.540 --> 00:44:01.938
Today is beautiful weather.

464
00:44:02.018 --> 00:44:04.296
Looks like sunny summer is starting.

465
00:44:05.734 --> 00:44:08.452
This is what the famous Bob Marley sang.

466
00:44:08.651 --> 00:44:11.888
The sun is bright and the day is sweet.

467
00:44:12.008 --> 00:44:14.406
Anyone and everyone dances.

468
00:44:17.163 --> 00:44:21.159
The heart is beating wildly, but it comes to mind
dear man.

469
00:44:21.239 --> 00:44:23.077
Today everything is fine.

470
00:44:26.274 --> 00:44:31.748
Don't keep track of time -
dissolve in it.

471
00:44:32.028 --> 00:44:35.504
Great day to create
unforgettable memories

472
00:44:36.024 --> 00:44:38.462
with loved ones.
Right now, without thinking,

473
00:44:38.741 --> 00:44:41.179
run towards them!

474
00:45:24.496 --> 00:45:25.496
Let's!

475
00:46:35.944 --> 00:46:37.423
Song Jae!

476
00:46:56.084 --> 00:46:58.122
Who is this? Stop!

477
00:47:23.776 --> 00:47:24.776
Who are you?

478
00:47:31.169 --> 00:47:34.446
How hard it was to suffer
alone.

479
00:47:34.765 --> 00:47:37.323
And there is no one to even talk to.

480
00:47:37.722 --> 00:47:39.800
I didn't know you felt so bad.

481
00:47:40.280 --> 00:47:42.038
I didn't know, forgive me.

482
00:47:46.793 --> 00:47:48.272
I love you, Sung Jae!

483
00:47:54.865 --> 00:47:56.983
- It’s written on the door!
- Let's take her away!

484
00:47:57.063 --> 00:47:59.980
What... What are you doing? I won't leave!

485
00:48:00.060 --> 00:48:03.736
Song Jae! I love you, Sung Jae!

486
00:48:03.816 --> 00:48:05.534
Song Jae!

487
00:48:05.614 --> 00:48:09.850
Let go! Ryu Sung Jae!

488
00:48:11.728 --> 00:48:15.564
I'll go out myself, wait. Wait!

489
00:48:15.644 --> 00:48:17.243
I'll come in for a second.

490
00:48:17.323 --> 00:48:19.121
- No.
- It is forbidden.

491
00:48:19.201 --> 00:48:21.718
Listen, girl, just don't tell me,
what I saw!

492
00:48:21.798 --> 00:48:24.675
- Last time...
- Get out of here already!

493
00:48:25.475 --> 00:48:28.112
How are you? Didn't you hit?

494
00:48:28.951 --> 00:48:30.669
I hit it, it hurt...

495
00:48:34.026 --> 00:48:35.026
Does it hurt?

496
00:48:35.864 --> 00:48:36.864
Why?

497
00:48:41.299 --> 00:48:42.897
Why don't I wake up?

498
00:48:43.257 --> 00:48:45.894
I was definitely wearing Sung Jae's watch.

499
00:48:52.288 --> 00:48:56.963
Found it. I found it, but... It turns out...

500
00:49:01.598 --> 00:49:02.877
Really...

501
00:49:06.713 --> 00:49:10.270
When a man reaches the end
your life path,

502
00:49:10.390 --> 00:49:12.867
the soul leaves his body.

503
00:49:12.947 --> 00:49:19.101
Passes over the bridge over the Samdocheon River
and goes to the afterlife.

504
00:49:20.060 --> 00:49:21.339
Really...

505
00:49:21.738 --> 00:49:23.097
am I dead?

506
00:49:38.721 --> 00:49:39.721
Do you hear?

507
00:49:44.396 --> 00:49:46.274
Welcome. What's happened?

508
00:49:51.628 --> 00:49:52.628
Are you here?

509
00:49:53.586 --> 00:49:54.586
Sorry!

510
00:49:55.744 --> 00:49:57.862
I'm definitely dead.

511
00:49:59.660 --> 00:50:00.660
What?

512
00:50:05.295 --> 00:50:06.454
Ghost?

513
00:50:07.173 --> 00:50:08.173
Ghost?

514
00:50:13.646 --> 00:50:14.685
Song Jae.

515
00:50:18.482 --> 00:50:22.398
-Are you crying again?
- Yes, since I see Sun Jae...

516
00:50:22.677 --> 00:50:24.396
That means she's definitely dead.

517
00:50:27.552 --> 00:50:28.552
What?

518
00:50:29.790 --> 00:50:31.828
Here you go. I have the same ones.

519
00:50:31.908 --> 00:50:33.666
These are yours, take them.

520
00:50:34.146 --> 00:50:35.624
- My?
- Yes.

521
00:50:35.704 --> 00:50:37.143
Well done.

522
00:50:38.182 --> 00:50:42.018
I'll be there so you don't feel
loneliness.

523
00:50:44.855 --> 00:50:47.692
My poor mother, what will happen to her?

524
00:50:47.892 --> 00:50:52.008
Mom... Grandma...

525
00:50:52.088 --> 00:50:55.245
No, a month has not passed yet, there is a way.

526
00:50:56.763 --> 00:50:58.002
Let's come back together.

527
00:50:58.322 --> 00:51:00.280
Just don't leave.

528
00:51:00.360 --> 00:51:02.038
I need to go home.

529
00:51:02.717 --> 00:51:03.717
No!

530
00:51:04.875 --> 00:51:06.513
No, Sung Jae, you can't!

531
00:51:06.593 --> 00:51:08.432
Can. I can.

532
00:51:09.870 --> 00:51:11.229
No, Sung Jae!

533
00:51:12.507 --> 00:51:14.266
Let's live, okay?

534
00:51:14.346 --> 00:51:16.264
Live together.

535
00:51:17.463 --> 00:51:18.621
Live together?

536
00:51:20.260 --> 00:51:22.577
- Taxi!
- Sun Jae!

537
00:51:24.855 --> 00:51:25.974
Let's go straight!

538
00:51:26.054 --> 00:51:27.213
Song Jae!

539
00:51:31.329 --> 00:51:32.368
Taxi?

540
00:51:33.207 --> 00:51:34.326
In the world of the dead?

541
00:51:42.078 --> 00:51:43.437
MOTHER

542
00:51:47.952 --> 00:51:50.110
- Hello?
- Where are you going?

543
00:51:50.190 --> 00:51:51.988
Are you skipping school?

544
00:51:52.428 --> 00:51:53.626
Mom's voice...

545
00:51:53.706 --> 00:51:56.583
Don't joke, run home!

546
00:51:56.663 --> 00:52:00.739
If you don't come within an hour,
I'll send you straight to hell!

547
00:52:00.819 --> 00:52:01.858
To hell?

548
00:52:06.454 --> 00:52:07.454
TRAINING SCHEDULE

549
00:52:10.290 --> 00:52:11.808
PHYSICAL SCIENCE TESTS

550
00:52:15.245 --> 00:52:18.002
Here comes our mako shark, Ryu Sung Jae!

551
00:52:18.082 --> 00:52:20.719
What shark, dad? This is weird.

552
00:52:20.799 --> 00:52:23.437
Asian Navy SEAL Cho Oh Ryung!

553
00:52:23.516 --> 00:52:27.033
Great Park Tae Hwan!
You don't even have to try.

554
00:52:27.992 --> 00:52:30.070
Well, did you ruin everyone?

555
00:52:30.150 --> 00:52:31.548
This is a rehearsal.

556
00:52:32.268 --> 00:52:33.268
But...

557
00:52:33.746 --> 00:52:37.103
- ...time is good.
- I'm proud of you, son!

558
00:52:37.183 --> 00:52:39.540
Of course I knew it!

559
00:52:39.980 --> 00:52:41.299
How's your shoulder?

560
00:52:41.379 --> 00:52:42.737
Fine.

561
00:52:47.013 --> 00:52:49.011
Dad, I'm coming.

562
00:52:50.010 --> 00:52:51.568
Yes. I'll call you back.

563
00:53:00.160 --> 00:53:03.437
How hard it was to suffer
alone.

564
00:53:03.916 --> 00:53:06.354
And there is no one to even talk to.

565
00:53:06.793 --> 00:53:08.871
I didn't know you felt so bad.

566
00:53:09.231 --> 00:53:11.069
I didn't know, forgive me.

567
00:53:11.668 --> 00:53:13.107
I love you, Sung Jae!

568
00:53:15.784 --> 00:53:17.103
Abnormal.

569
00:53:21.099 --> 00:53:22.099
What?

570
00:53:25.495 --> 00:53:27.572
In terms of? Are they the same?

571
00:53:29.131 --> 00:53:31.329
Then why did she give them to me?

572
00:53:36.324 --> 00:53:37.522
GYMA VIDEO AND DVD

573
00:53:38.681 --> 00:53:39.681
FOR RENT

574
00:53:40.639 --> 00:53:41.758
NURIDON 34-1

575
00:53:43.556 --> 00:53:45.195
Go crazy.

576
00:53:45.994 --> 00:53:47.552
Still, it wasn’t like that.

577
00:53:48.232 --> 00:53:50.310
Have they done renovations here?

578
00:54:01.578 --> 00:54:02.578
Mother?

579
00:54:04.376 --> 00:54:06.494
Go... Go... Come here!

580
00:54:08.531 --> 00:54:13.447
Salt! You left your backpack at school
and went for a walk somewhere?

581
00:54:14.925 --> 00:54:15.925
Mother.

582
00:54:16.444 --> 00:54:17.682
You are so young!

583
00:54:17.762 --> 00:54:20.360
Don't suck up, it won't help you!

584
00:54:20.440 --> 00:54:22.597
Why are you skipping?

585
00:54:22.677 --> 00:54:24.755
Graduation class, and she’s unclear
what he's doing!

586
00:54:24.835 --> 00:54:27.672
Wait, mom, wait! Wait...

587
00:54:27.872 --> 00:54:29.910
JUNE 2008

588
00:54:31.469 --> 00:54:33.387
2008?

589
00:54:36.983 --> 00:54:40.340
How lucky my granddaughter is,
so much delicious food!

590
00:54:40.420 --> 00:54:42.577
Come here. Try.

591
00:54:42.657 --> 00:54:44.416
Grandmother!

592
00:54:44.496 --> 00:54:49.930
Mommies, mommies! No no!
Don't push so hard, or I'll break.

593
00:54:50.130 --> 00:54:51.648
Look at me.

594
00:54:52.008 --> 00:54:53.087
Do you recognize?

595
00:54:53.167 --> 00:54:55.684
Of course, my granddaughter Sol!

596
00:54:59.081 --> 00:55:01.439
Yes. I am Sol.

597
00:55:01.518 --> 00:55:02.877
Wow...

598
00:55:04.715 --> 00:55:08.671
One more time. Say my name again.
Please.

599
00:55:08.871 --> 00:55:10.430
Salt!

600
00:55:13.187 --> 00:55:17.582
Why cry?
Who hurt my girl?

601
00:55:18.901 --> 00:55:20.060
Grandma...

602
00:55:21.299 --> 00:55:22.299
Mommies.

603
00:55:23.576 --> 00:55:24.935
Mommies.

604
00:56:18.881 --> 00:56:20.200
It's June now...

605
00:56:21.079 --> 00:56:23.237
I haven't had an accident yet.

606
00:56:42.977 --> 00:56:44.695
Mom...

607
00:56:45.455 --> 00:56:47.293
Grandma...

608
00:56:47.373 --> 00:56:48.492
Yes.

609
00:56:49.371 --> 00:56:50.649
Why are you crying?

610
00:56:55.085 --> 00:56:57.243
So strange.

611
00:56:58.042 --> 00:57:00.919
I can't feel my legs at all.

612
00:57:02.358 --> 00:57:03.796
What's happened?

613
00:57:05.275 --> 00:57:07.433
I don't remember.

614
00:57:56.903 --> 00:58:00.579
Will I be able to wake up here tomorrow?

615
00:58:15.964 --> 00:58:17.922
And if this is just a dream...

616
00:58:18.641 --> 00:58:22.917
and tomorrow morning mysteriously
will everything around disappear?

617
00:58:49.411 --> 00:58:50.809
The legs don't move.

618
00:58:52.248 --> 00:58:55.285
Certainly. This is a dream.

619
00:59:00.759 --> 00:59:01.759
Go away!

620
00:59:04.316 --> 00:59:05.316
What?

621
00:59:09.231 --> 00:59:10.270
What's happened?

622
00:59:11.189 --> 00:59:12.189
What?

623
00:59:13.387 --> 00:59:14.825
My Geum!

624
00:59:15.465 --> 00:59:19.780
Lim Geum! Dear brother!

625
00:59:19.860 --> 00:59:23.377
Let me go, Sol! Let go...

626
00:59:25.175 --> 00:59:26.973
I'm going to school!

627
00:59:35.964 --> 00:59:39.441
When leaving home, take with you
small umbrella.

628
00:59:39.520 --> 00:59:43.596
It's unbearably hot,
so we are looking forward to the rain.

629
00:59:43.676 --> 00:59:48.272
Temperatures are high in Seoul
shower clouds are approaching.

630
00:59:48.352 --> 00:59:51.029
The forecast calls for rain soon.

631
00:59:51.269 --> 00:59:55.664
Heavy rain is expected
don't forget to take an umbrella.

632
01:00:00.819 --> 01:00:04.695
- Don't want!
- Is it true? You can go crazy like that!

633
01:00:06.653 --> 01:00:08.132
We need to return them.

634
01:00:08.611 --> 01:00:10.929
- Hello!
- Hello!

635
01:00:15.684 --> 01:00:17.203
Hello!

636
01:00:17.283 --> 01:00:21.718
- What, are you taking a walk?
- Come here!

637
01:00:29.271 --> 01:00:30.549
Faster, let's run!

638
01:00:36.543 --> 01:00:37.702
Song Jae.

639
01:00:42.178 --> 01:00:45.175
DEPRESSED SINGER
COMMITTED YOURSELF

640
01:00:45.934 --> 01:00:46.934
Song Jae!

641
01:00:50.010 --> 01:00:52.408
- Well done.
- Leave me alone already.

642
01:00:52.488 --> 01:00:55.405
- Well done!
- Of course, well done!

643
01:02:33.546 --> 01:02:34.945
Why are you crying?

644
01:02:40.420 --> 01:02:42.777
Why are you crying? I didn't cry.

645
01:03:13.387 --> 01:03:16.384
GRAB SUN JAE AND RUN

646
01:03:16.543 --> 01:03:19.381
I want to make friends with a person, but how?

647
01:03:20.220 --> 01:03:21.978
- Drop it.
- Give up.

648
01:03:22.058 --> 01:03:24.975
No! Do you have bad habits?

649
01:03:25.055 --> 01:03:26.055
What do you want?

650
01:03:26.693 --> 01:03:29.371
- Hi!
- She likes Kim Tae Sun.

651
01:03:29.451 --> 01:03:31.369
- Who is this?
- Don't know him?

652
01:03:31.449 --> 01:03:33.167
- Ryu Sung Jae.
-Who are you?

653
01:03:33.566 --> 01:03:36.084
Sun Jae, just don't go into the water.

654
01:03:39.001 --> 01:03:40.280
Who's there?

655
01:03:40.519 --> 01:03:43.397
- Why are you doing this to me?
- I want to protect you.

656
01:03:43.477 --> 01:03:45.874
I will do anything to keep you alive.

657
01:03:46.593 --> 01:03:49.391
Translated and voiced by the studio
"Mobile TV"

658
01:03:49.471 --> 01:03:51.908
commissioned by the online cinema Ivy
in 2024.

